{
  "title": "Another Dua Tawassul",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَعَلٰى اِبْنَتِهِ وَعَلٰى اِبْنَيْهَا وَاَسْئَلُكَ بِهِمْ اَنْ تُعِيْنَنِىْ عَلٰى طَاعَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA A'LAA IBNATIHI WA A'LAA IBNAYHAA WA AS-ALUKA BIHIM AN TU-I'NANEE A'LAA TAA-A'TIKA WA RIDWAANIKA\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad, his daughter, and her two sons, and I ask You by them to help me in obeying You and attaining Your pleasure,\nوَاَنْ تُبَلِّغَنِىْ بِهِمْ اَفْضَلَ مَا بَلَّغْتَ اَحَدًا مِنْ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ اِنَّكَ جَوَادٌ كَرِيْمٌ\nWA AN TUBALLIGHANEE BIHIM AFDALA MAA BALLAGHTA AHADAM MIN AWLIYAAA-IKA INNAKA JAWAADUN KAREEM\nand to grant me, in their name, the best of what You have granted any of Your intimate servants; verily You are munificent, generous.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ عَلِىِّ بْنِ اَبِىْ طَالِبٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI AMEERIL MU'MINEENA A'LEE-YIBNI ABEE TAALIBIN A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of the Commander of the Faithful, Ali ibn Abi Talib, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا انْتَقَمْتَ بِهِ مِمَّنْ ظَلَمَنِىْ وَغَشَمَنِىْ وَاٰذَانِىْ وَانْطَوٰى عَلٰى ذٰلِكَ\nILLAN TAQAMTA BIHI MIMMAN ZALAMANEE WA GHASHAMANEE WA AAZAANEE WANTAWAA A'LAA ZAALIK\nto take revenge, through him, on whoever has wronged me, oppressed me, harmed me, or harbors that intent,\nوَكَفَيْتَنِىْ بِهِ مَؤُنَةَ كُلِّ اَحَدٍ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nWA KAFAYTANEE BIHI MOO-NATA KULLI AHADIN YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nand to spare me, through him, the burden of everyone else, O Most Merciful of the merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ عَلِىِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKA A'LEE-YIBNIL HUSAYNI A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, Ali ibn al-Husayn, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا كَفَيْتَنِىْ بِهِ مَؤُنَةَ كُلِّ شَيْطَانٍ مَرِيْدٍ وَسُلْطَانٍ عَنِيْدٍ\nILLAA KAFAYTANEE BIHI MOO-NATA KULLI SHAYTAANIM MAREEDIN WA SULTAANIN A'NEED\nto spare me, through him, the burden of every rebellious devil and every obstinate tyrant\nيَتَقَوّٰى عَلَىَّ بِبَطْشِهِ وَيَنْتَصِرُ عَلَىَّ بِجُنْدِهِ اِنَّكَ جَوَادٌ كَرِيْمٌ يَا وَهَّابُ\nYATAQAWWAA A'LAYYA BI-BATSHIHI WA YANTASIRU A'LAYYA BI-JUNDIHI INNAKA JAWAADUN KAREEMUY YAA WAHHAAB\nwho grows strong against me by his violence and prevails against me with his forces; verily You are munificent, generous, O Bestower.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيَّيْكَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ وَجَعْفَرِ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِمَا السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYAYKA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LEE-YIN WA JA'FARIBNI MUHAMMADIN A'LAYHIMAS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your two intimate servants, Muhammad ibn Ali and Ja'far ibn Muhammad, peace be upon them,\nاِلَّا اَعَنْتَنِىْ بِهِمَا عَلٰى اَمْرِ اٰخِرَتِىْ بِطَاعَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ\nILLAA A'ANTANEE BIHIMAA A'LAA AMRI AAKHIRATEE BI-TAA-A'TIKA WA RIDWAANIKA\nto help me, through them, in the affairs of my Hereafter through obedience to You and Your pleasure,\nوَبَلَّغْتَنِىْ بِهِمَا مَا يُرْضِيْكَ اِنَّكَ فَعَّالٌ لِمَا تُرِيْدُ\nWA BALLAGHTANEE BIHIMAA MAA YURDEEKA INNAKA FA-A'A'LUL LIMAA TUREED\nand to bring me, through them, to whatever pleases You; verily You do whatever You will.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ مُوْسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKA MOOSAA IBNI JA'FARIN A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, Musa ibn Ja'far, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا عَافَيْتَنِىْ بِهِ فِىْ جَمِيْعِ جَوَارِحِىْ مَا ظَهَرَ مِنْهَا وَمَابَطَنَ يَا جَوَادُ يَا كَرِيْمُ\nILLAA A'AAFAYTANEE BIHI FEE JAMEE-I' JAWAARIHEE MAA ZAHARA MINHAA WA MAA BATAN YAA JAWAADO YAA KAREEM\nto grant me well-being, through him, in all my faculties — outward and inward — O Munificent, O Generous.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ الرِّضَا عَلِىِّ بْنِ مُوْسٰى عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKAR RIDAA A'LEE-YIBNI MOOSAA A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, al-Rida Ali ibn Musa, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا سَلَّمْتَنِىْ بِهِ فِىْ جَمِيْعِ اَسْفَارِىْ فِى الْبَرَارِىْ وَالْبِحَارِ وَالْجِبَالِ والْقِفَارِ وَالْاَوْدِيَةِ وَالْغِيَاضِ\nILLAA SALLAMTANEE BIHI FEE JAMEE-I' ASFAAREE FIL BARAAREE WAL BIHAARI WAL JIBAALI WAL QIFAARI WAL AWDIYATI WAL GHIYAAD\nto keep me safe, through him, in all my journeys — on land and sea, in mountains, deserts, valleys, and forests —\nمِنْ جَمِيْعِ مَا اَخَافُهُ وَاَحْذَرُهُ اِنَّكَ رَؤُفٌ رَحِيْمٌ\nMIN JAMEE-I' MAA AKHAAFUHU WA AHZARUHU INNAKA RA-OOFUR RAHEEM\nfrom all that I fear or am wary of; verily You are kind, merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKA MUHAMMADIBNI A'LEE-YIN A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, Muhammad ibn Ali, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا جُدْتَ بِهِ عَلَىَّ مِنْ فَضْلِكَ وَتَفَضَّلْتَ بِهِ عَلىَّ مِنْ وُسْعِكَ وَوَسَّعْتَ عَلَىَّ رِزْقَكَ\nILLAA JUDTA BIHI A'LAYYA MIN FADLIKA WA TAFADDALTA BIHI A'LAYYA MIN WUS-I'KA WA WASSA'TA A'LAYYA RIZQAK\nto be generous with me, through him, from Your bounty, to favor me, through him, from Your abundance, and to expand my sustenance,\nوَاَغْنَيْتَنِىْ عَمَّنْ سِوَاكَ وَجَعَلْتَ حَاجَتِىْ اِلَيْكَ وَقَضَاهَا عَلَيْكَ اِنَّكَ لِمَا تَشَاۤءُ قَدِيْرٌ\nWA AGHNAYTANEE A'MMAN SIWAAKA WA JA-A'LTA HAAJATEE ILAYKA WA QADAAHAA A'LAYKA INNAKA LIMAA TASHAAA-O QADEER\nand to make me needless of anyone but You, placing my need with You alone for You to settle; verily You have power over whatever You will.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ عَلِىِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKA A'LEE-YIBNI MUHAMMADIN A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, Ali ibn Muhammad, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا اَعَنْتَنِىْ بِهِ عَلٰى تَاْدِيَةِ فُرُوْضِكَ وَبِرِّ اِخْوَانِىَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَسَهِّلْ ذٰلِكَ لِىْ وَاقْرُنْهُ بِالْخَيْرِ\nILLAA A'ANTANEE BIHI A'LAA TA-DIYATI FUROODIKA WA BIRRI IKHWAANIYAL MU'MINEENA WA SAHHIL ZAALIKA LEE WAQRUNHU BIL KHAYR\nto help me, through him, to fulfil Your obligations and to be dutiful to my believing brethren, making that easy for me and joining it with good,\nوَاَعِنِّىْ عَلٰى طَاعَتِكَ بِفَضْلِكَ يَا رَحِيْمُ\nWA A'INNEE A'LAA TAA-A'TIKA BI-FADLIKA YAA RAHEEM\nand to help me obey You through Your bounty, O Merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ الْحَسَنِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKAL HASANIBNI A'LEE-YIN A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant, al-Hasan ibn Ali, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا اَعَنْتَنِىْ بِهِ عَلٰى اَمْرِ اٰخِرَتِىْ بِطَاعَتِكَ وَرِضْوَانِكَ\nILLAA A'ANTANEE BIHI A'LAA AMRI AAKHIRATEE BI-TAA-A'TIKA WA RIDWAANIKA\nto help me, through him, in the affairs of my Hereafter through obedience to You and Your pleasure,\nوَسَرَرْتَنِىْ فِىْ مُنْقَلَبِىْ وَمَثْوَاىَ بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nWA SARARTANEE FEE MUNQALABEE WA MATHWAAYA BI-RAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nand to gladden me in my return and my final abode through Your mercy, O Most Merciful of the merciful.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّىْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ وَلِيِّكَ وَحُجَّتِكَ صَاحِبِ الزَّمَانِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI WALIYYIKA WA HUJJATIKA SAAHIBIZ ZAMAANI A'LAYHIS SALAAM\nO Allah, I ask You by the right of Your intimate servant and Proof, the Master of the Age, peace be upon him,\nاِلَّا اَعَنْتَنِىْ بِهِ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ اُمُوْرِىْ وَكَفَيْتَنِىْ بِهِ مَؤُنَةَ كُلِّ مُوْذٍ وَطَاغٍ وَبَاغٍ\nILLAA A'ANTANEE BIHI A'LAA JAMEE-I' UMOOREE WA KAFAYTANEE BIHI MOO-NATA KULLI MOOZIN WA TAAGHIN WA BAAGH\nto help me, through him, in all my affairs, and to spare me, through him, the burden of every one who harms, transgresses, or oppresses,\nوَاَعَنْتَنِىْ بِهِ فَقَدْ بَلَغَ مَجْهُوْدِى وَكَفَيْتَنِىْ بِهِ كُلَّ عَدُوٍّ وَهَمٍّ وَغَمٍّ وَدَيْنٍ\nWA A'ANTANEE BIHI FAQAD BALAGHA MAJHOODEE WA KAFAYTANEE BIHI KULLA A'DUWWIW WA HAMMIW WA GHAMMIW WA DAYN\nand help me, through him, for my effort has reached its limit, and spare me, through him, every enemy, worry, grief, and debt,\nعَنِّىْ وَعَنْ وُلْدِىْ وَجَمِيْعِ اَهْلِىْ وَاِخْوَانِىْ وَمَنْ يَعْنِيْنِىْ اَمْرُهُ وَخَاۤصَّتِىْ اٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nA'NNEE WA A'N WULDEE WA JAMEE-I' AHLEE WA IKHWAANEE WA MAY YA'NEENEE AMRUHU WA KHAAA-SSATEE AAMEEN RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nfrom myself, my children, all my family, my brethren, whoever's affair concerns me, and those close to me; Amen, O Lord of the worlds.",
  "merits": "In al-Balad al-Amin, Shaykh al-Kaf'ami records this brief supplication as Dua al-Faraj (The Supplication of Relief). Sayyid Ali Khan, quoting Shaykh al-Sahrashti's Qabas al-Masabih, gives it with an explanatory commentary in al-Kalim al-Tayyib, omitted here for brevity."
